[Term]
id: AISM:0000057
name: prementum {AISM:0000171="Beutel RG, Friedrich F, Yang X-K, Ge S-Q (2014) Insect Morphology and Phylogeny Insect morphology and phylogeny: a textbook for students of entomology. De Gruyter.\n\nhttps://doi.org/10.1515/9783110264043\n\n\"Prementum: distal main element of labium, bearing the endite lobes (glossa and paraglossa) and the labial palp.\""}
def: "The sclerite of the labium that is connected to the mentum by the mental-premental conjunctiva, to the palpiger by the premental-palpigeral conjunctiva, to the paraglossa by the premental-paraglossal conjunctiva, and to the glossa by the premental-glossal conjunctiva." [] {x_1.1:contributor="jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883", creation_date="2021-02-19"}
