intersection_of: AISM:0000174 {x_1.1:contributor="jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883", creation_date="2021-08-01"} ! insect region of cuticle
intersection_of: UBERON:6007289 {x_1.1:contributor="jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883", creation_date="2021-08-01"} ! insect tagmatic subdivision of integument
