synonym: "endosternite" EXACT [] {AISM:0000171="Beutel RG, Friedrich F, Yang X-K, Ge S-Q (2014) Insect Morphology and Phylogeny Insect morphology and phylogeny: a textbook for students of entomology. De Gruyter.\n\nhttps://doi.org/10.1515/9783110264043\n\n\"Furca (=sternal apophysis, endosternite): endoskeletal element (entapophysis) of furcasternum; paired furcal arms often connected with pleural ridge by short muscle.\""}
is_a: AISM:0000136 {x_1.1:contributor="imiko https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2938-9075"} ! branching cuticular invagination
