def: "The cuticular depression that is elongated and coincides with the distal side of an insect sclerite." [] {creation_date="2021-04-21", x_1.1:contributor="jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883", IAO:0000232="Modified 2024-01-25: to reflect subclass of definiton\njgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883"}
