[Term]
id: AISM:0000158
name: cuticular ridge {AISM:0000171="Beutel RG, Friedrich F, Yang X-K, Ge S-Q (2014) Insect Morphology and Phylogeny Insect morphology and phylogeny: a textbook for students of entomology. De Gruyter.\n\nhttps://doi.org/10.1515/9783110264043\n\n\"Ridge: cuticular strengthening ridge.\"\n\"They are not lines of fusion or molting lines.\"(p. 12)", term:modified="2021-12-10"}
