relationship: RO:0002150 AISM:0000093 {x_1.1:contributor="imiko https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2938-9075"} ! continuous with hypopharynx
relationship: RO:0002150 AISM:0000134 {x_1.1:contributor="imiko https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2938-9075"} ! continuous with cuticular exocrine gland duct

