name: inferolateral tentorio-mandibular muscle {AISM:0000171="Wipfler B, Machida R, Mueller B, Beutel RG (2011). On the head morphology of Grylloblattodea (Insecta) and the systematic position of the order, with a new nomenclature for the head muscles of Dicondylia. Systematic Entomology, 36(2), 241-266.\n\n https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1365-3113.2010.00556.x\n\n\"Origin: Anterior tentorial arm\"\n\n\"Insertion: Ventral basal margin of the mandible\""}
