[Term]
id: AISM:0004004
name: insect mentum {AISM:0000171="Beutel RG, Friedrich F, Yang X-K, Ge S-Q (2014) Insect Morphology and Phylogeny Insect morphology and phylogeny: a textbook for students of entomology. De Gruyter.\n\nhttps://doi.org/10.1515/9783110264043\n\n\"Mentum: intermediate part of labium, anterior part of postmentum; bears the prementum at its distal edge.\"", IAO:0000232="Modified 2023-01-20: to specify insect mentum.\njgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883"}
def: "The sclerite of the labium that is anterior to the submentum and posterior to the prementum, and attached to the prementum by the mental-premental conjunctiva." [] {x_1.1:contributor="jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883", creation_date="2021-02-17"}
