[Term]
id: AISM:0004006
name: palpiger {AISM:0000171="Beutel RG, Friedrich F, Yang X-K, Ge S-Q (2014) Insect Morphology and Phylogeny Insect morphology and phylogeny: a textbook for students of entomology. De Gruyter. \n\nhttps://doi.org/10.1515/9783110264043\n\n\"Palpiger: small separate element of prementum, bears the labial palp.\"", IAO:0000232="Modified 2023-04-13: removed ‘cuticle of’ from label.\nstarasov https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5237-2330"}
