[Term]
id: AISM:0004020
name: frons {AISM:0000171="Beutel RG, Friedrich F, Yang X-K, Ge S-Q (2014) Insect Morphology and Phylogeny Insect morphology and phylogeny: a textbook for students of entomology. De Gruyter.\n\nhttps://doi.org/10.1515/9783110264043\n\n\"Frons: frontal part of head capsule, delimited by ecdysial lines (frontal sutures); often triangular and bearing unpaired (median) ocellus.\""}
def: "The region of cuticle of the head capsule that is located posterior to the clypeus and delimited by the frontal suture." [] {creation_date="2021-04-03", x_1.1:contributor="jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883"}
