relationship: BFO:0000051 AISM:0004041 {x_1.1:contributor="jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883"} ! has part neuroforamen
relationship: RO:0002150 AISM:0000019 {x_1.1:contributor="jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883"} ! continuous with head capsule
