def: "The ridge of the head capsule that separates the clypeus and the frons." [] {creation_date="2021-02-24", x_1.1:contributor="jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883"}
is_a: AISM:0000158 {x_1.1:contributor="jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883"} ! cuticular ridge
