[Term]
id: AISM:0004066
name: endophallite {AISM:0000171="Génier F (2019) Endophallites: a proposed neologism for naming the sclerotized elements of the insect endophallus (Arthropoda: Insecta). Annales de la Société entomologique de France (N.S.) 55: 482–484. \n\nhttps://doi.org/10.1080/00379271.2019.1685907 \n\n\"endophallite(s) refer to the sclerotized structures of the endophallus whether the structure be circular, flat, folded or spiniform.\""}
