[Term]
id: AISM:0004154
name: anepisternum {AISM:0000171="Beutel RG, Friedrich F, Yang X-K, Ge S-Q (2014) Insect Morphology and Phylogeny Insect morphology and phylogeny: a textbook for students of entomology. De Gruyter.\n\nhttps://doi.org/10.1515/9783110264043\n\n\"Anepisternum: dorsal part of episternum, ventrally delimited by anapleural suture.\""}
def: "The dorsal region of the episternum that is dorsal to the anapleural sulcus." [] {x_1.1:contributor="jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883", creation_date="2021-04-09"}
