def: "The region of cuticle of the insect wing that is more flexible than the wing conjunctiva." [] {creation_date="2021-09-07", x_1.1:contributor="jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883"}
is_a: AISM:0000174 {x_1.1:contributor="jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883"} ! insect region of cuticle
relationship: BFO:0000050 AISM:0000033 {x_1.1:contributor="jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883"} ! part of insect wing

