id: AISM:0004270
name: mandibular molar lobe {AISM:0000171="Nichols, S. W. (1989) Torre-Bueno glossary of entomology. New York Entomological Society. 840 pp.\n\nhttps://ipmhouse.tamu.edu/files/2021/03/The-Torre-Bueno-Glossary-of-Entomology.pdf\n\n\"the ridged or roughened grinding surface of the mandible\"", creation_date="2022-06-20"}
