name: mediostipes {AISM:0000171="Beutel RG, Friedrich F, Yang X-K, Ge S-Q (2014) Insect Morphology and Phylogeny Insect morphology and phylogeny: a textbook for students of entomology. De Gruyter.\n\nhttps://doi.org/10.1515/9783110264043\n\n\"Mediostipes: mesal part of stipes.\""}
def: "The region of cuticle on the medial region of the cuticle of stipes, adjacent to the distal margin of the cuticle of the basistipes, and to the proximal margin of the cuticle of the galea and the lacinia." [] {creation_date="2022-06-23", x_1.1:contributor="jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883"}
